.TH HOODMIN 8 "2026-10-18" "Hoodmin 0.1.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
hoodmin \- independent VPN management panel
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hoodmin --help
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run as the unprivileged hoodmin account. DATABASE_URL and VHM_MASTER_KEY_FILE are required. The serve command listens only on loopback and requires an HTTPS reverse proxy. Configuration is in /etc/hoodmin/hoodmin.env. See the packaged production setup guide before initializing an instance.
.SH SEE ALSO
/usr/share/doc/hoodmin/docs/uretim-kurulumu.md
